{"3404170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Together We Play: Help Me Help You", "steam_appid": 3404170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404170/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1783651962\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404170/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1783651962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404170/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1783651962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Together We Play: Help Me Help You,</strong> join your friends to embark on a hilarious cooperative adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this colorful multiplayer game, gather up to <strong>8 players</strong> and dive into a series of levels filled with quirky challenges, puzzles, and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Work together to find the Golden Key that unlocks the door to victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a colorful world where teamwork is essential. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level presents unique obstacles that require clever collaboration and communication. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against funny challenges that will test your skills and creativity as you strategize</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with your friends to overcome each hurdle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on fun and laughter, <strong>Together We Play:</strong> <strong>Help Me Help You</strong> is designed for players of all ages. </p><p c